{"n":106,"videoId":"e3U2b6tRmnI","question":"What Is Your Biggest Fear?","method":"premiere","answers":[{"t":10.09,"dur":1.75,"text":"Greed.","frame":"e3U2b6tRmnI/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":11.85,"dur":1.79,"text":"I don’t have any fear","frame":"e3U2b6tRmnI/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":13.64,"dur":4.21,"text":"My biggest fear is not being able to speak out","frame":"e3U2b6tRmnI/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":17.85,"dur":5.76,"text":"Not being vocal about the issues surrounding me","frame":"e3U2b6tRmnI/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":23.61,"dur":7.59,"text":"Dying early because I have children I want to be able to grow old, and to get my children to get married and stuff","frame":"e3U2b6tRmnI/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":31.2,"dur":12.6,"text":"I really like the people around me so I suppose... it would be... being alone something happening to our children","frame":"e3U2b6tRmnI/001.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":51.63,"dur":3.0,"text":"I don't have any biggest fear right now","frame":"e3U2b6tRmnI/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":56.64,"dur":1.96,"text":"The climate change","frame":"e3U2b6tRmnI/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":60.85,"dur":2.38,"text":"me losing my family my wife","frame":"e3U2b6tRmnI/003.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":63.23,"dur":0.83,"text":"Yeah. Me too","frame":"e3U2b6tRmnI/003.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":64.06,"dur":2.09,"text":"Nothing, ya","frame":"e3U2b6tRmnI/003.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":66.15,"dur":5.97,"text":"People are forgetting nature and going into the system.","frame":"e3U2b6tRmnI/003.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":72.11,"dur":4.38,"text":"So, like in Fiji, we have everything But we are depending on money.","frame":"e3U2b6tRmnI/003.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":76.49,"dur":10.39,"text":"We h